[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5401.91, "timestamp": "01:30:01", "text": "比如，如果我去见某人，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5404.229, "timestamp": "01:30:04", "text": "或者我直接就选他们了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5406.79, "timestamp": "01:30:06", "text": "大家都像这样，很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5410.709, "timestamp": "01:30:10", "text": "所以事情就是这样，还有另一个。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5410.884, "timestamp": "01:30:10", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you mean so much to them"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5413.99, "timestamp": "01:30:13", "text": "我觉得，是的，信任"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5417.189, "timestamp": "01:30:17", "text": "信任是可以……的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5421.27, "timestamp": "01:30:21", "text": "很容易被打破，对吧？没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5423.189, "timestamp": "01:30:23", "text": "是的，即使你和……是朋友"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5424.074, "timestamp": "01:30:24", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "true"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5427.03, "timestamp": "01:30:27", "text": "给他们12年、20年、10年或5年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5428.629, "timestamp": "01:30:28", "text": "不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5432.95, "timestamp": "01:30:32", "text": "是的，有时对某些人来说，唱歌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5435.35, "timestamp": "01:30:35", "text": "一个错误就可能造成毁灭性的打击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5438.709, "timestamp": "01:30:38", "text": "他们之间有着多年的友谊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5440.709, "timestamp": "01:30:40", "text": "他们之所以信任彼此，是因为他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5443.27, "timestamp": "01:30:43", "text": "对他们很失望。甚至那个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5445.43, "timestamp": "01:30:45", "text": "他们自己都不知道也不理解"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5448.229, "timestamp": "01:30:48", "text": "他们犯了同样的错误，现在依然如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5451.35, "timestamp": "01:30:51", "text": "不尊重对方。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5453.59, "timestamp": "01:30:53", "text": "感觉好像你不是我的朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5456.229, "timestamp": "01:30:56", "text": "就像我最初那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5459.91, "timestamp": "01:30:59", "text": "而且，那里也有像我这样的人。"}]